Subject: Cantor Phase3 Topology Acquisition Lineage Forms Revision 0.2 Justification

& [JustificationIdentity] is exact
  + [justification_uuid] is 9bf188ed-8337-4f82-ba8a-7cbd1546c05f
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 2e6aaaca-8265-43b4-b0d7-b793013c74fd
  + [protocol_uuid] is aad1eb00-c43a-40a9-baca-dc75fbe25a6d
  + [requirements] are P3TALF-001 through P3TALF-014
  + [state] is corrective_justified_unsigned

& [Need] is correct the infeasible 0.1 serde boundary without weakening complete carrier ancestry
  + current carriers are intentionally output-only and cannot appear inside a deserializable input graph
  + later pure reasoning still needs caller-decodable identity scope role order reconciliation-plan and requested-grade metadata
  + a split metadata plan plus separately owned typed carriers preserves both requirements

& [WhyMetadataAndCarrierSplit] is necessary
  + metadata remains strict inspectable round-trip transport
  + complete current carriers remain impossible to reconstruct through this transport
  + the function signature encodes exactly two carrier arguments and fixed role association
  + output-only bindings retain complete ancestry after validation

& [WhyExactJoins] is necessary
  + complete metadata equality alone cannot prove it describes either supplied carrier
  + encoding limits fixed root shape strong root identity and current profiles are exposed by the carrier graph and must match
  + root reference volume-GUID policy and predecessor coordinates are not exposed and therefore remain declared-only exact common metadata
  + explicit classification prevents both omission and provenance inflation

& [WhyCompileTimeTraitProof] is mandatory
  + the invalidated generation failed because prose and derive feasibility diverged
  + positive and negative trait assertions directly measure the disputed Rust property
  + the pre-signature ignored probe passed against exact current modules
  + the final module must carry the same assertions under cfg(test)

& [AlternativesRejected] are complete
  + make the current carrier Deserialize is rejected as predecessor weakening
  + decode a bare digest assembly locator key or summary is rejected as ancestry loss
  + add a stable carrier reference profile is rejected as new unsourced authority
  + keep carrier-bearing input metadata is rejected as structurally infeasible
  + omit metadata-only scope coordinates is rejected as incomplete common scope
  + treat metadata-only coordinates as carrier proof is rejected as provenance inflation
  + add producer admission receipt issuance clock persistence or effects is rejected as physical scope growth

& [RiskReduction] is measurable
  + fourteen requirements map through thirty constraints eighteen threats and seven folds
  + one executable trait probe closes eight positive and five negative type assertions
  + candidate remains one safe module one export existing dependencies and zero effects
  + historical invalidation is preserved rather than overwritten

& [CostAndRollback] are bounded
  + governance plus one later pure module with fixed two-carrier work
  + no current module dependency Cargo or effect change
  + before implementation rollback removes only the 0.2 derived generation
  + after implementation rollback reverts the additive module export tests and evidence because runtime state is empty

& [Decision] is justified for replacement canonicalization only
  + implementation remains prohibited until a new artifact-bound satisfaction signature
  + physical M2C producer issuer consumer and every external effect remain separately sourced
